# secret-exports.zsh must never be adopted or symlinked whole-directory into
# this repo. ~/.config/zsh was already a stow-managed directory symlink, which
# is exactly what turned a routine fix into permanently losing the only copy
# of this file. Keep it native to $HOME; only a symlink pointing out to it
# belongs in this repo, added deliberately, never via stow.
^secret-exports\.zsh$
